<Slide style={{ background: '#0B1020', padding: 60 }}>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-end' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>⑥ 信息流：给个网址，之后它自己收</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B' }}>08 / 功能 6</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 1, background: 'rgba(34,211,238,0.4)', marginTop: 14 }} />

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 22, marginTop: 20 }}>
        <Image src="assets/feed-list.png" style={{ width: 660, height: 372, objectFit: 'cover', borderRadius: 8, border: '1px solid #334155' }} />

        <Box style={{ width: 478, gap: 12 }}>
            <Box style={{ padding: 12, background: '#151B33', borderRadius: 8, borderLeft: '3px solid #F0ABFC' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>添加只要一个网址</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8', marginTop: 6 }}>粘首页地址，它自己探测是 RSS / JSON / 网页</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ padding: 12, background: '#151B33', borderRadius: 8, borderLeft: '3px solid #F0ABFC' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>按网站自己的栏目分类</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8', marginTop: 6 }}>通知公告 / 新闻动态 分开排，顶部可快筛</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ padding: 12, background: '#151B33', borderRadius: 8, borderLeft: '3px solid #F0ABFC' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>定时自己去抓，不用你管</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8', marginTop: 6 }}>后台常驻，浏览器关了照样抓；没更新就跳过</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ padding: 12, background: '#151B33', borderRadius: 8, borderLeft: '3px solid #F0ABFC' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>读到哪一层都行</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8', marginTop: 6 }}>AI 摘要 / 显示原文（抽屉） / 打开网址</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ marginTop: 12, padding: 14, background: '#151B33', borderRadius: 8, borderLeft: '3px solid #22D3EE' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#E2E8F0' }}>
            <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#22D3EE' }}>方便在哪</span>
            ：以前要挨个打开三个学院网站刷一遍才知道有没有新通知，现在打开就是按栏目排好的列表。
        </Text>
    </Box>

    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B', position: 'absolute', left: 60, top: 670 }}>个人工作台 · v0.2.0</Text>
</Slide>
